  "description": "Persistent inbox-style notification center for BlazOrbit. Stores `BOBNotification` entries via a swappable `INotificationStore` strategy (default: in-memory; consumers can supply localStorage / IndexedDB / server-side persistence) and ships the `BOBNotificationBell` badge component for the unread count. Pairs with any consumer-supplied UI (drawer, popover, panel) for the list.",
